<tier id="TIE0" speaker="SPK0" category="v" type="t" display-name="FS [v]"><event start="T2" end="T3">¡Hola! </event>
<event start="T3" end="T4">¡Buenos días! </event>
<event start="T5" end="T6">• • </event>
<event start="T6" end="T7">¡Muchas gracias! </event>
<event start="T8" end="T9">• • </event>
<event start="T9" end="T10">((ríe)) La curva del Pardo es una curva de la/ </event>
<event start="T10" end="T11">del hipódromo de la Zarzuela en/ en Madrid. </event>
<event start="T11" end="T12">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T12" end="T13">Yyy, en fin, eh para los hípicos tiene mucho significado lo </event>
<event start="T13" end="T14">que supongo (que) para los demás no les suena nada especial. </event>
<event start="T16" end="T17">• • </event>
<event start="T17" end="T18">Sí sí! </event>
<event start="T21" end="T22">No </event>
<event start="T22" end="T23">tiene/ no tiene templarios, </event>
<event start="T23" end="T24">no tiene sectas. </event>
<event start="T24" end="T25">((rí</event>
<event start="T25" end="T26">e, 1,3s)) </event>
<event start="T26" end="T27">Pues sí, es un poco atípica. </event>
<event start="T27" end="T28">Pero a lo mejor la gente ya está un poco cansada </event>
<event start="T28" end="T29">de todas esas cosas, y y quiere cambiar, </event>
<event start="T29" end="T30">yo tengo la esperenza que quiera cambiar. </event>
<event start="T30" end="T31">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T38" end="T39">• • </event>
<event start="T39" end="T40">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T40" end="T41">Bueno hom… </event>
<event start="T41" end="T42">mmm, de todo… </event>
<event start="T42" end="T43">((ríe)) </event>
<event start="T43" end="T44">(E gira) • el/ e la/ </event>
<event start="T44" end="T45">todo gira en torno a una gran carrera de caballos </event>
<event start="T45" end="T46">donde dos magnates que se odian cordialmente pues </event>
<event start="T46" end="T47">((inspira)) e quieren dividir sus/ em sus odios/ </event>
<event start="T47" end="T48">e m cada uno con sus caballos. </event>
<event start="T48" end="T49">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T49" end="T50">Y el caballo más importante </event>
<event start="T50" end="T51">— el mejor de todos — pues ee </event>
<event start="T51" end="T52">• </event>
<event start="T52" end="T53">necesita un jinete determinado que lo monte porque es el único que lo entiende bien. </event>
<event start="T53" end="T54">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T54" end="T55">Y este jinete ha desaparecido. </event>
<event start="T55" end="T56">Entonces hay que buscar a ese jinete. </event>
<event start="T56" end="T57">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T57" end="T58">Y un poco en eso trata la novela. </event>
<event start="T64" end="T65">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T65" end="T66">¡Sí, eso es! </event>
<event start="T66" end="T67">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T67" end="T68">Bueno el/ </event>
<event start="T68" end="T69">es una novela… </event>
<event start="T70" end="T71">• • </event>
<event start="T71" end="T72">Bueno, e… </event>
<event start="T72" end="T73">Hombre e e… </event>
<event start="T73" end="T74">• • </event>
<event start="T74" end="T75">Nooo/ no hay que asustarse. </event>
<event start="T75" end="T76">No es/ no </event>
<event start="T76" end="T77">es una novela de </event>
<event start="T77" end="T78">filosofía, ni bien… </event>
<event start="T78" end="T79">Pero bueno yo creo que cada uno </event>
<event start="T79" end="T80">• • </event>
<event start="T80" end="T81">ya … </event>
<event start="T81" end="T82">• • </event>
<event start="T82" end="T83">en fin el lector lo verá… </event>
<event start="T83" end="T84">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T84" end="T85">Como la novela está narrada a varias voces, </event>
<event start="T85" end="T86">o sea hay varios personajes que cuentan cada uno </event>
<event start="T86" end="T87">su perspectiva sobre lo que está ocurriendo, </event>
<event start="T87" end="T88">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T88" end="T89">cada uno de los personajes está por un lao contando lo que pasa </event>
<event start="T89" end="T90">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T90" end="T91">y por otro </event>
<event start="T91" end="T92">lao </event>
<event start="T92" end="T93">contando lo que le pasa a él: </event>
<event start="T93" end="T94">• • </event>
<event start="T94" end="T95">sus sueños, sus miedos, sus frustraciones, </event>
<event start="T95" end="T96">sus/ ((inspira)) sus </event>
<event start="T96" end="T97">nostalgias </event>
<event start="T97" end="T98">etcétera ¿no? </event>
<event start="T98" end="T99">Entonces… </event>
<event start="T99" end="T100">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T100" end="T101">E a la vez • están interviniendo en la acción </event>
<event start="T101" end="T102">como protagonistas, </event>
<event start="T102" end="T103">y también rememorando y recordando </event>
<event start="T103" end="T104">pues lo que es su vida ¿no? </event>
<event start="T104" end="T105">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T105" end="T106">Entonces eso/ eso/ esa rememoración </event>
<event start="T106" end="T107">pues tiene eso, pues un poquito de aliño metafísico. </event>
<event start="T114" end="T115">No no sí, no/ yo vi/ </event>
<event start="T115" end="T116">mi/ mi campo </event>
<event start="T116" end="T117">es el ensayo, es el artículo, no sé. </event>
<event start="T117" end="T118">Yo esto me ha venido/ • • me ha venido muy bien </event>
<event start="T118" end="T119">porque durante un año muy complicado como ha sido este </event>
<event start="T119" end="T120">que en fin si se recuerda </event>
<event start="T120" end="T121">pues hemos lanzao un partido político nuevo. </event>
<event start="T121" end="T122">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T122" end="T123">Hemos afrontao unas elecciones </event>
<event start="T123" end="T124">sin poca o/ o ninguna ayuda </event>
<event start="T124" end="T125">de medios y de bancos y de tal. </event>
<event start="T125" end="T126">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T126" end="T127">Hemos lograo tener una parlamentaria. </event>
<event start="T127" end="T128">Yo he dao mi último curso en la facultad </event>
<event start="T128" end="T129">porque este año ha sido el de mi jubilación. </event>
<event start="T129" end="T130">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T130" end="T131">Eeh mmm eh mmm </event>
<event start="T131" end="T132">nos hemos lanzado el manifiesto de la lengua común </event>
<event start="T132" end="T133">que termina teniendo bastante polémica. </event>
<event start="T133" end="T134">Y es decir yo (creo que ha sido) un año bastante cargado de acontecimientos. </event>
<event start="T134" end="T135">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T135" end="T136">Entonces eh la novela me servía para refugiarme, </event>
<event start="T136" end="T137">para escaparme ¿no? </event>
<event start="T137" end="T138">Eran mis vacaciones diarias. </event>
<event start="T138" end="T139">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T139" end="T140">Me iba una hora o dos horas a mi mundo especial </event>
<event start="T140" end="T141">privado de/ ((inspira)) de esa novela. </event>
<event start="T141" end="T142">Y ahí me refugiaba y se me olvidaba durante un rato </event>
<event start="T142" end="T143">todo lo que estaba pasando y/ </event>
<event start="T143" end="T144">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T144" end="T145">y me ha venido muy bien. </event>
<event start="T145" end="T146">Y ojalá que a algún lector le sirva para lo mismo ¿no? </event>
<event start="T147" end="T148">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T148" end="T149">• • </event>
<event start="T149" end="T150">Bueno yo creo que la ética es una reflexión sobre nuestra libertad </event>
<event start="T150" end="T151">• </event>
<event start="T151" end="T152">y la filosofía pues de alguna manera es una reflexión sobre nuestra vida. </event>
<event start="T152" end="T153">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T153" end="T154">Yyy hombre me parece que </event>
<event start="T154" end="T155">siempre — sobre todo cuando estamos mmm eh comoo </event>
<event start="T155" end="T156">dicen tiempos turbulentos — </event>
<event start="T156" end="T157">es bueno reflexionar sobre lo que nos pasa, </event>
<event start="T157" end="T158">sobre lo que queremos hacer. </event>
<event start="T158" end="T159">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T159" end="T160">(Es decir) </event>
<event start="T160" end="T161">en vez de dejarnos siempre arrastrar por los acontecimientos </event>
<event start="T161" end="T162">y seguir el el el/ la corriente pues, </event>
<event start="T162" end="T163">mmm mmm también decidir </event>
<event start="T163" end="T164">qué es lo que vamos a hacer y qué preferimos nosotros. </event>
<event start="T164" end="T165">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T165" end="T166">Y qué/ como ser protagonista de nuestra vida ¿no? </event>
<event start="T168" end="T169">((inc.))˙ </event>
<event start="T170" end="T171">Eh˙ </event>
<event start="T172" end="T173">Eh˙ </event>
<event start="T174" end="T175">¡Muy bien! </event>
<event start="T175" end="T176">¡Gracias </event>
<event start="T176" end="T177">a vosotros! </event>
<event start="T177" end="T178">¿E? </event>
<event start="T178" end="T179">¡Adiós! </event>
<event start="T179" end="T180">¡Buenos días! </event>
<event start="T180" end="T181">¡Buen</event>
<event start="T181" end="T182">os días! </event>
</tier><tier id="TIE1" speaker="SPK0" category="akz" type="a" display-name=""><event start="T96" end="T97">—</event>
</tier><tier id="TIE2" speaker="SPK0" category="en" type="a" display-name="FS [en]"><event start="T2" end="T3">Hello! </event>
<event start="T3" end="T4">Good day! </event>
<event start="T5" end="T6">• • </event>
<event start="T6" end="T7">Thank you very much! </event>
<event start="T8" end="T9">• • </event>
<event start="T9" end="T11">((laughs)) The Pardo's Curve is a curve of the/ of the race-course of the Zarzuela in/ in Madrid. </event>
<event start="T11" end="T12">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T12" end="T14">Aaand, finally, for horse enthusiasts this place is very significant, which I assume for other people doesn't mean anything special. </event>
<event start="T16" end="T17">• • </event>
<event start="T17" end="T18">Yes, yes! </event>
<event start="T21" end="T23">It doens't have / it doesn't have Templars, </event>
<event start="T23" end="T24">it doesn't have sects. </event>
<event start="T24" end="T25">((laugh</event>
<event start="T25" end="T26">s, 1,3s)) </event>
<event start="T26" end="T27">Yes indeed, it's somewhat atypical. </event>
<event start="T27" end="T29">But perhaps people are already a bit tired of all those things, and and they want to change, </event>
<event start="T29" end="T30">I hope to change them. </event>
<event start="T30" end="T31">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T38" end="T39">• • </event>
<event start="T39" end="T40">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T40" end="T41">Well, Sir... </event>
<event start="T41" end="T42"> ehm, anyway... </event>
<event start="T42" end="T43">((laughs)) </event>
<event start="T43" end="T44">(Eh it centers) • / it/ eh it/ </event>
<event start="T44" end="T46">anyway, it centers on a big horse-race where two moguls who hate each other with all their hearts </event>
<event start="T46" end="T48">((breathes)) eh want to share their/ em their hatreds/ each one with their horses. </event>
<event start="T48" end="T49">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T49" end="T50">And the most important horse </event>
<event start="T50" end="T51">— the best one of all — well eeh </event>
<event start="T51" end="T52">• </event>
<event start="T52" end="T53">needs a determined jockey who mounts it, because he is the only one who understands it. </event>
<event start="T53" end="T54">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T54" end="T55">And this jockey has disappeared. </event>
<event start="T55" end="T56">That's why this jockey has to be found. </event>
<event start="T56" end="T57">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T57" end="T58">And that is sort of how this novel goes. </event>
<event start="T64" end="T65">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T65" end="T66">Yes, that' it! </event>
<event start="T66" end="T67">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T67" end="T68">Well the/ </event>
<event start="T68" end="T69">it's a novel... </event>
<event start="T70" end="T71">• • </event>
<event start="T71" end="T72">Well eh... </event>
<event start="T72" end="T73">Sir eh eh... </event>
<event start="T73" end="T74">• • </event>
<event start="T74" end="T75">You don't/ don't have to get frightened.</event>
<event start="T75" end="T78">It isn't/ isn't a philosophical novel nor well... </event>
<event start="T78" end="T79">But, well, I think that every one </event>
<event start="T79" end="T80">• • </event>
<event start="T80" end="T81">well... </event>
<event start="T81" end="T82">• • </event>
<event start="T82" end="T83">finally the reader will see it... </event>
<event start="T83" end="T84">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T84" end="T85">Since the novel is narrated by various voices, </event>
<event start="T85" end="T86">this means different characters tell one by one </event>
<event start="T86" end="T87">their perpective about what is happening </event>
<event start="T87" end="T88">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T88" end="T89">each one of the characters is telling on one side what happens </event>
<event start="T89" end="T90">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T90" end="T93">and on the other side is telling what happens to him: </event>
<event start="T93" end="T94">• • </event>
<event start="T94" end="T95">his dreams, his fears, his frustrations, </event>
<event start="T95" end="T98">his/ ((breathes)) his aspirations and so on, right? </event>
<event start="T98" end="T99">That's why... </event>
<event start="T99" end="T100">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T100" end="T102">And at the same time • they are intervening in the action as main characters, </event>
<event start="T102" end="T104">and also remembering and recalling well what is his life, right? </event>
<event start="T104" end="T105">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T105" end="T106">That's why this/ this/ this rememberance </event>
<event start="T106" end="T107">well, has this, well, a bit of metaphysical flavour. </event>
<event start="T114" end="T115">No no yes, no/ I saw/ </event>
<event start="T115" end="T116">my/ my field </event>
<event start="T116" end="T117">is the essay, is the article, I don't know.</event>
<event start="T117" end="T118">I, this did/ • • did me lots of good </event>
<event start="T118" end="T119">because during a very complicated year as this one has been </event>
<event start="T119" end="T120">which, well, if you remember </event>
<event start="T120" end="T121">well we placed on the market a new political party. </event>
<event start="T121" end="T122">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T122" end="T123">We had to affront some elections </event>
<event start="T123" end="T124">with few or/ or no help </event>
<event start="T124" end="T125">from media and from banks and from such things. </event>
<event start="T125" end="T126">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T126" end="T127">We achieved to have a parlamentarian. </event>
<event start="T127" end="T129">And I gave my last course in the faculty because this year has been the one of my retirement. </event>
<event start="T129" end="T130">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T130" end="T131">Ehm mmm eh ehm </event>
<event start="T131" end="T133">we haved placed on the market the manifest of the common language which finally got much polemics. </event>
<event start="T133" end="T134">And which means I (think it has been) a year quite charged with events. </event>
<event start="T134" end="T135">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T135" end="T136">That's why ehm the novel served me to flee, </event>
<event start="T136" end="T137">to escape, right? </event>
<event start="T137" end="T138">These were my daily holidays. </event>
<event start="T138" end="T139">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T139" end="T141">I went to my special private world of/ ((breathes)) of that novel for one hour or two hours. </event>
<event start="T141" end="T142">And there I escaped and I forgot for a while </event>
<event start="T142" end="T143">everything that had happened and/ </event>
<event start="T143" end="T144">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T144" end="T145">and it did me lots of good. </event>
<event start="T145" end="T146">And hopefully it will do the same thing to some reader, won't it? </event>
<event start="T147" end="T148">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T148" end="T149">• • </event>
<event start="T149" end="T150">Well, I think ethics is a reflection about our freedom </event>
<event start="T150" end="T151">• </event>
<event start="T151" end="T152">and philosophy is somehow a reflection about our life.</event>
<event start="T152" end="T153">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T153" end="T154">Aaand, Sir, it appears to me that </event>
<event start="T154" end="T156">always — especially when we are like they say in turbulent times — </event>
<event start="T156" end="T157">it is good to think about what happens to us, </event>
<event start="T157" end="T158">about what we want to do. </event>
<event start="T158" end="T159">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T159" end="T160">(Which means) </event>
<event start="T160" end="T162">instead of being always dragged by the events and following the the the/ the current, </event>
<event start="T162" end="T163">ehmehm also decide </event>
<event start="T163" end="T164">what is the thing we want to do and prefer. </event>
<event start="T164" end="T165">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T165" end="T166">And what/ like beeing the main character of our life, isn't it? </event>
<event start="T168" end="T169">((inc.))˙ </event>
<event start="T170" end="T171">Eh˙ </event>
<event start="T172" end="T173">Eh˙ </event>
<event start="T174" end="T175">Very good!</event>
<event start="T175" end="T177">Thanks to you!</event>
<event start="T177" end="T178">OK? </event>
<event start="T178" end="T179">Goodbye!</event>
<event start="T179" end="T180">Good day!</event>
<event start="T180" end="T182">Good day!</event>
</tier><tier id="TIE3" speaker="SPK1" category="v" type="t" display-name="LR [v]"><event start="T1" end="T2">¡Fernando Savater, buenos días! </event>
<event start="T4" end="T5">¡Enhorabuena! </event>
<event start="T7" end="T8">¿La curva del Pardo es esa dónde se ve a la señora? </event>
<event start="T14" end="T15">Bueno, estaba pensando en esa leyenda urbana. </event>
<event start="T15" end="T16">¿Pero la cosa va de hípica? </event>
<event start="T17" end="T18">En/ • </event>
<event start="T18" end="T19">en esta novela que mmm </event>
<event start="T19" end="T20">((inspira)) no tiene • • catedrales, no tiene guerras. </event>
<event start="T20" end="T21">No sé si va a ser un éxito </event>
<event start="T21" end="T22">¿eh? </event>
<event start="T24" end="T25">((ríe))˙ </event>
<event start="T31" end="T32">La Hermandad de la Buena Suerte… </event>
<event start="T32" end="T33">mmm </event>
<event start="T33" end="T34">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T34" end="T35">• • </event>
<event start="T35" end="T36">mmm˙ </event>
<event start="T36" end="T37">• • • </event>
<event start="T37" end="T38">¿Qué hacen los caballos en esta obra? </event>
<event start="T58" end="T59">• • • </event>
<event start="T59" end="T60">Es una novela — Usted mismo lo ha dicho —</event>
<event start="T60" end="T61">y además me parece la definición — </event>
<event start="T61" end="T62">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T62" end="T63">eh si me permite — muy inteligente, </event>
<event start="T63" end="T64">una obra de aventuras con un poquito de aliño metafísico. </event>
<event start="T68" end="T69">¡Dígame Usted lo que es el </event>
<event start="T69" end="T70">aliño metafísico! </event>
<event start="T76" end="T77">((rié))˙ </event>
<event start="T107" end="T108">Ha escrito más de cuarenta y cinco </event>
<event start="T108" end="T109">• libros </event>
<event start="T109" end="T110">entre ellos desde luego esa ((inspira)) eh imprescindible </event>
<event start="T110" end="T111">y que es libro de cabecera para muchos padres que quieren ser educadores es "Ética para Amador". </event>
<event start="T111" end="T112">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T112" end="T113">Eh mmm ¿va a darle más a la novela </event>
<event start="T113" end="T114">o va seguir centrado en la </event>
<event start="T114" end="T115">ética (en las relaciones)? </event>
<event start="T146" end="T147">¿La ética y la filosofía pueden ser un buen punto de apoyo en estos tiempos tur</event>
<event start="T147" end="T148">bulentos? </event>
<event start="T166" end="T167">((inspira)) </event>
<event start="T167" end="T168">¡Fernando Savater, muchisimas gracias al </event>
<event start="T168" end="T169">Premio </event>
<event start="T169" end="T170">Plan</event>
<event start="T170" end="T171">eta </event>
<event start="T171" end="T172">por com</event>
<event start="T172" end="T173">partir </event>
<event start="T173" end="T174">este tiempo con los oyentes de Radio Nacional! </event>
<event start="T176" end="T177">¡Buenos días! </event>
<event start="T178" end="T179">((inc.))˙ </event>
<event start="T179" end="T181">((inc.))˙ </event>
</tier><tier id="TIE4" speaker="SPK1" category="en" type="a" display-name="LR [en]"><event start="T1" end="T2">Fernando Savater, good day! </event>
<event start="T4" end="T5">Congratulation! </event>
<event start="T7" end="T8">The Pardo's Curve, is this the place where the woman is seen? </event>
<event start="T14" end="T15">Well, I was thinking of that urban legend. </event>
<event start="T15" end="T16">But the thing is about equitation? </event>
<event start="T17" end="T18">In/ • </event>
<event start="T18" end="T19">in this novel, which ehm </event>
<event start="T19" end="T20">((breathes)) doesn't have • • cathedrals, doesn't have wars. </event>
<event start="T20" end="T21">I don't know if it will be a success, </event>
<event start="T21" end="T22">you know? </event>
<event start="T24" end="T25">((laughs))˙ </event>
<event start="T31" end="T32">The Brotherhood of the Good Luck... </event>
<event start="T32" end="T33">ehm </event>
<event start="T33" end="T34">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T34" end="T35">• • </event>
<event start="T35" end="T36">ehm˙ </event>
<event start="T36" end="T37">• • • </event>
<event start="T37" end="T38">What do the horses do in this work? </event>
<event start="T58" end="T59">• • • </event>
<event start="T59" end="T60">It is a novel — you said it yourself — </event>
<event start="T60" end="T61">and additionally I think the definition — </event>
<event start="T61" end="T62">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T62" end="T63">eh if you allow me — very intelligent, </event>
<event start="T63" end="T64">a work of adventures with a little metaphysical flavor. </event>
<event start="T68" end="T70">Tell me what is the metaphysical flavor! </event>
<event start="T76" end="T77">((laughs))˙ </event>
<event start="T107" end="T108">You have written more than fourty-five </event>
<event start="T108" end="T109">• books </event>
<event start="T109" end="T110">among them of course, this ((breathes)) eh indispensable one </event>
<event start="T110" end="T111">and which is a bedside book for many parents who want to be educators is "Esthics for Amador". </event>
<event start="T111" end="T112">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T112" end="T115">Em, em are you going to add something more to this novel or are you going to continue centered on the ethics (in the relations)? </event>
<event start="T146" end="T148">Can ethics and philosophy be a good point of support in these turbulent times? </event>
<event start="T166" end="T167">((breathes)) </event>
<event start="T167" end="T174">Fernando Savater, thank you very much to the winner of the Planeta Price for spending this time with the audience of Radio Nacional! </event>
<event start="T176" end="T177">Good day! </event>
<event start="T178" end="T179">((inc.))˙ </event>
<event start="T179" end="T181">((inc.))˙ </event>
</tier></basic-body>
